---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<Base title="About" narrow>
	<h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
	<article class="prose">
		<p>{site.author.bio}</p>
		<p>This site runs on <a href={site.repo}>Astro AI Starter</a>: an Astro blog where the AI features (ask the blog, TL;DR, translate, ask the author, read next) run in the reader's browser through <a href="https://onetagai.com/?ref=astro-ai-starter">OneTag AI</a>. There is no server and no API key in the page, only a public key that can spend this site's free allowance.</p>
		<p>Find me on <a href={site.author.links.github}>GitHub</a>.</p>
	</article>
</Base>
